data: {"id": "acc014f925214e97-final", "run_id": "acc014f925214e97", "seq": 1140, "ts_ms": 1789121358717, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v04/workload` | ContainerCreating | Pod aiops-case-v04/workload 处于 ContainerCreating 状态，无法启动容器 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | Pod / Container | 状态 `ContainerCreating`；Waiting 原因 `ContainerCreating` (fact-50d794affca1) | 直接确认异常现象与当前阻塞阶段 |\n| 2 | K8s State | Pod Condition | `ContainersReady=False` (`ContainersNotReady: [app]`), `Ready=False` (fact-e710be4aa073) | 证实容器未能就绪，非健康或重启状态 |\n| 3 | K8s State | Resource Context | `cpu_request=5m`, `cpu_limit=50m`; `memory_request=8Mi`, `memory_limit=32Mi` (fact-18e52bb3dfb3 等) | 资源请求量极低，无资源挤占或配额耗尽迹象 |\n| 4 | K8s State | Restart Count | `restart_count=0` (fact-c158d7269e5c) | 排除因 OOMKilled 或 CrashLoopBackOff 导致的状态异常 |\n| 5 | Metric | Waiting Reason | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason=1` (reason=ContainerCreating, fact-2d7ef2d8d7d6) | 独立观测确认 Pod 卡在挂载或创建前置阶段的指标事实 |\n\nPod 未重启且资源请求极低，排除了应用崩溃与资源竞争因素；等待原因 `ContainerCreating` 与指标一致，结合未就绪条件，强烈指向容器启动前的挂载或前置依赖失败，而非容器内应用逻辑问题。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod 定义引用不存在的 Secret 'unavailable-input' → Kubelet 挂载卷失败 (FailedMount) → Pod 持续处于 ContainerCreating 状态 → 无法启动容器\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认的根因**：Pod `aiops-case-v04/workload` 声明了一个名为 `input` 的 Volume，该 Volume 试图挂载 Secret `unavailable-input`。由于该 Secret 在命名空间 `aiops-case-v04` 中不存在，Kubelet 在尝试挂载该卷时发生 `FailedMount` 错误。\n\n这一失败导致 Pod 卡在 `ContainerCreating` 阶段，无法进行容器镜像拉取及容器进程启动。证据 #1、#2 及 #5 一致确认了 Pod 停留在创建阶段且未就绪，且未发生重启（证据 #4），符合挂载失败阻塞容器启动的特征。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.0m\n├─ 问题定位: 23.8s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 30.0s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v04/workload: 30.0s (Evidence 22.8s, RCA 7.2s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 8.6s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v04/workload**: pod-imagepull-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 62.433, "metrics": {"run_id": "acc014f925214e97", "mttr": {"value": "1.0m", "seconds": 62.44068455696106, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-imagepull-failed", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-imagepull-failed"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 62440.68455696106, "llm_calls": 10, "llm_duration_ms": 59592.06461906433, "tool_calls": 9, "executed_tool_calls": 9, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 0, "successful_tool_calls": 9, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 6849.100589752197, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 2539.645195007324}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 23763.48090171814, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 30031.094074249268, "s